{"id": 475, "title": "A snake in the drinking cup", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "a-snake-in-the-drinking-cup", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/475_a-snake-in-the-drinking-cup.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["乐广有一个好朋友，很长时间不来看乐广。乐广问他为什么，朋友回答：“以前在你家，你请我喝酒，喝酒的时候，我看见杯里边有一条蛇，心里很害怕，喝了以后，就生了重病。”", "乐广家的墙上有弓，弓上画着一条蛇。乐广猜杯中的蛇就是弓的影子。他在一样的地方又请那位朋友喝酒，对朋友说：“杯中是否又看见了什么东西？”朋友回答：“我看见的跟上次一样。”乐广就告诉他为什么，客人听了心情好了，重病也好了。", "现在人们用“杯弓蛇影”说一些人因为一点儿事情就怀疑，这是不对的。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["樂廣有一個好朋友，很長時間不來看樂廣。樂廣問他為什麼，朋友回答：“以前在你家，你請我喝酒，喝酒的時候，我看見杯裡邊有一條蛇，心裡很害怕，喝了以後，就生了重病。”", "樂廣家的牆上有弓，弓上畫著一條蛇。樂廣猜杯中的蛇就是弓的影子。他在一樣的地方又請那位朋友喝酒，對朋友說：“杯中是否又看見了什麼東西？”朋友回答：“我看見的跟上次一樣。”樂廣就告訴他為什麼，客人聽了心情好了，重病也好了。", "現在人們用“杯弓蛇影”說一些人因為一點兒事情就懷疑，這是不對的。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["Yuè Guǎng yǒu yī gè hǎo péng you， hěn cháng shí jiān bù lái kàn Yuè Guǎng。 Yuè Guǎng wèn tā wèi shén me， péng you huí dá：“ yǐ qián zài nǐ jiā， nǐ qǐng wǒ hē jiǔ， hē jiǔ de shí hou， wǒ kàn jiàn bēi lǐ bian yǒu yī tiáo shé， xīn lǐ hěn hài pà， hē le yǐ hòu， jiù shēng le zhòng bìng。”", "Yuè Guǎng jiā de qiáng shàng yǒu gōng， gōng shàng huà zhe yī tiáo shé。 Yuè Guǎng cāi bēi zhōng de shé jiù shì gōng de yǐng zi。 tā zài yī yàng de dì fang yòu qǐng nà wèi péng you hē jiǔ， duì péng you shuō：“ bēi zhōng shì fǒu yòu kàn jiàn le shén me dōng xi？” péng you huí dá：“ wǒ kàn jiàn de gēn shàng cì yī yàng。” Yuè Guǎng jiù gào su tā wèi shén me， kè rén tīng le xīn qíng hǎo le， zhòng bìng yě hǎo le。", "xiàn zài rén men yòng“ bēi gōng shé yǐng” shuō yī xiē rén yīn wèi yī diǎn r shì qing jiù huái yí， zhè shì bù duì de。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Le Guang had a good friend who had not come to see him for a long time. When Le Guang asked why, his friend replied, “Last time I was at your house, you offered me some wine. As I drank, I saw a snake in my cup. It frightened me, and afterward I became seriously ill.”", "There was a bow hanging on the wall of Le Guang’s house, with a snake painted on it. Le Guang guessed that the snake in the cup had been the bow’s reflection. He invited his friend to drink wine again in the same spot and asked, “Do you see anything in your cup this time?” His friend answered, “I see the same thing as last time.” Le Guang explained what it was. Once his friend understood, he felt better, and his illness went away too.", "Today, people use the expression “mistaking a bow’s reflection in a cup for a snake” to describe someone who becomes suspicious over a small matter. There is no need for such suspicion."], "english_full": "Le Guang had a good friend who had not come to see him for a long time. When Le Guang asked why, his friend replied, “Last time I was at your house, you offered me some wine. As I drank, I saw a snake in my cup. It frightened me, and afterward I became seriously ill.”\n\nThere was a bow hanging on the wall of Le Guang’s house, with a snake painted on it. Le Guang guessed that the snake in the cup had been the bow’s reflection. He invited his friend to drink wine again in the same spot and asked, “Do you see anything in your cup this time?” His friend answered, “I see the same thing as last time.” Le Guang explained what it was. Once his friend understood, he felt better, and his illness went away too.\n\nToday, people use the expression “mistaking a bow’s reflection in a cup for a snake” to describe someone who becomes suspicious over a small matter. There is no need for such suspicion.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Yuè Guǎng\" data-defn=\"a scholar in Liang-era\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">乐广</span><span class=\"tr\">樂廣</span><rt>Yuè Guǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-de